<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107545" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερηφᾰν-έω</span></b> , used by <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> once in part., much <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερηνορέων</span>
			, <i>overweening, arrogant,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερηφανέοντες Ἐπειοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.694
				</span></i>
			: hence later writers formed the Verb, <i>to be arrogant,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ne.</u>
					9.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.10.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Vit.</u>
				p.11
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				3.1.1
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later
			writers also used it in a trans. sense, <i>treat disdainfully,</i>
			c. acc., <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				23.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				6.3.4
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				X.Eph.
				1.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1676.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>, etc.: c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				21.249b
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nigr.</u>
				31
			</span></i>: c. acc. et inf., <i>scorn</i> that . . ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Longus
				4.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἑαυτούς</span>
			<i>extol</i> themselves, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.33.8
			</span></i>.</div>
